# Keeps Docker build contexts small and free of local state and secrets.

# dependencies and build output (each image installs and builds its own)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# environment files: real values never enter an image (examples are documentation)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# tests, tooling and editor state
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.claude
.vscode
.idea
**/*.log
